# TLS_MODE=internal (the default).
#
# Caddy's own internal CA issues the cert. Zero secrets, zero external network, boots on a
# fresh clone — which is why it is the default: nobody should be blocked on a Tailscale
# auth key to see the app.
#
# Cost: the browser does not trust Caddy's root CA until you install it. On the phone that
# means one "install profile" step. When that becomes annoying, switch to TLS_MODE=tailscale.
tls internal
